      "value": "Root Worker"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "pc2"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Some ailments can't be cured by herbs alone. You learned ritual remedies as well, calling on nature spirits to soothe aches and ward off the evil eye. Taking up with adventurers has given you company on the road, as well as protection from those who would brand you a fake—or worse.\n\nChoose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence or Wisdom, and one is a free attribute boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Occultism skill and the Herbalism Lore skill. You gain the Root Magic skill feat."
    },
